  "lineage": "TCP congestion-control lineage, the HISTORICAL REDESIGN: Van Jacobson and Mike Karels added a congestion window (snd_cwnd), slow start, congestion avoidance (additive increase / multiplicative decrease), Karn's retransmission-timer rule and the mean+variance RTT estimator to 4.3BSD-Tahoe in response to the 1986 collapse. Preserved from unix-history-repo tag BSD-4_3_Tahoe.",
